<title>POLAND: BFK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK AUG NET RISES TO PLN 2.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results August</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.89 vs   2.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.56 vs   1.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.34 vs   2.36</p>
<p> Sales		   33.11 vs  29.71</p>
<p>JANUARY-AUGUST</p>
<p> Net profit	    18.27 vs  10.49</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	29.56 vs  14.68</p>
<p> Operating profit    36.27 vs  27.99</p>
<p> Sales		  235.54 vs 200.87</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
